{
  "about": "B650 first draft of the fixed query set (ADR 0124 D16): 80 hand-written queries in eleven classes, each with the result it can really reach on the corpus at 0cb3abe. `expect` is the expected first result, `top3` the other ids that count for the top three, `answers` the expected flow answers, `behaviour` the expected behaviour id, `needs` a condition on later work (SQ16), `mode` the door (very-easy: Home's bar; easy: the toolbar; advanced: the toolbar in Advanced), `project` the open mod. Never regenerated: a change needs a reason.",
